\page

\pard\b\f1\fs32 1. Overview\b0\f0\fs24\par
\pard\fs24 This beta testing report documents functional verification of Fieldpass across key user roles and their major workflows:\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Superadmin: user roles and permissions management\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Association Manager: association-level administration workflows\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Club Manager: club-level workflows and club dashboard access\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Player: player login and player dashboard access\par
\pard\fs24\par
\pard\b Objectives\b0\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Confirm role-based access control (RBAC) behaves as expected.\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Validate primary end-to-end workflows for each role.\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Record results and defects for follow-up before wider rollout.\par
\pard\fs24\par
\pard\b Exit criteria\b0\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab No critical severity defects in authentication, authorization, or core workflows.\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab All high-priority test cases pass (or have an approved mitigation).\par

\page

\pard\b\f1\fs32 2. Test Environment\b0\f0\fs24\par
\pard\b Environments used\b0\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Local development environment (developer workstation)\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Beta server environment (DigitalOcean droplet / containerized deployment)\par
\pard\fs24\par
\pard\b Test data\b0\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Admin accounts for: Superadmin, Association Manager, Club Manager\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Player accounts for: OTP/password login (as configured)\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Representative entities: association(s), club(s), competitions/matches (where applicable)\par
\pard\fs24\par
\pard\b Tools\b0\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Web browser (Chromium-based)\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Server logs: Nginx + container logs\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Database inspection (read-only) as needed to validate writes\par

\page

\pard\b\f1\fs32 3. Beta Test Coverage \& Results\b0\f0\fs24\par
\pard\fs24 Note: Results are captured as \b Pass / Fail / Not Tested\b0 with optional notes. Defects discovered should be logged with severity (Critical/High/Medium/Low) and reproduction steps.\par
\pard\fs24\par

\pard\b\f1\fs28 3.1 Superadmin \u8212? User Roles \& Permissions\b0\f0\fs24\par
\pard\b Scope\b0\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Roles management (create/edit)\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Permissions assignment by group\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Admin creation and role assignment\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Validation of RBAC impact on sidebar navigation and route access\par
\pard\fs24\par
\pard\b Test cases\b0\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Create a new role and assign a permission group (e.g., dashboard.view).\tab Result: ________\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Edit an existing role; toggle permissions on/off; verify saved.\tab Result: ________\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Create admin user; assign role; confirm login and menu visibility.\tab Result: ________\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Remove permission from a role; confirm restricted page returns 403.\tab Result: ________\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Verify superadmin can access management pages (admins/roles).\tab Result: ________\par
\pard\fs24\par
\pard\b Expected outcomes\b0\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Role changes immediately affect authorization (after permission cache refresh).\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Unauthorized routes are blocked (403) and UI navigation hides restricted items.\par
\pard\fs24\par

\pard\b\f1\fs28 3.2 Association Manager Functions\b0\f0\fs24\par
\pard\b Scope\b0\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Association dashboard access\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Association-scoped admin/user management (where allowed)\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Competition creation/management and invitations (as configured)\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Club visibility and access limited to association scope\par
\pard\fs24\par
\pard\b Test cases\b0\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Login as Association Manager; dashboard renders association context.\tab Result: ________\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab View competitions list; verify only association competitions shown.\tab Result: ________\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Create/update competition (if enabled); verify persisted.\tab Result: ________\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Manage competition invitations; approve/reject flow.\tab Result: ________\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Create Club Manager (or allowed roles) under association and link to club.\tab Result: ________\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Attempt to access out-of-scope association data; expect 403/hidden.\tab Result: ________\par
\pard\fs24\par
\pard\b Expected outcomes\b0\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Data and actions are constrained to the manager\u8217?s association.\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Unauthorized cross-association access is blocked.\par
\pard\fs24\par

