\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Successful authentication routes the player to the correct dashboard.\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Invalid authentication does not create a session.\par
\pard\li360\fs24\bullet\tab Protected routes require an active player session.\par

